        "id": "T01-10",
        "fromId": "zhangjianguo",
        "at": "2026-10-12 23:19",
        "content": "我送你。",
        "evidenceId": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "T01-11",
        "fromId": "chenguisheng",
        "at": "2026-10-12 23:21",
        "content": "我自己打车。那五万块，你也别惦记了。你家嫂子现在能出来转转，比什么都强。",
        "evidenceId": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "T01-12",
        "fromId": "zhangjianguo",
        "at": "2026-10-13 00:06",
        "content": "到了给个信。别又不回。",
        "evidenceId": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "T01-13",
        "fromId": "chenguisheng",
        "at": "2026-10-13 00:29",
        "content": "到了。卤锅火记得关。",
        "evidenceId": "EV_VOLUNTARY"
      }
    ]
